---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'June 2025';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Tech To Empower"
  description="How Tech To Empower collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <section class="legal section">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <header class="legal__head" data-reveal-group>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--muted reveal">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="legal__title reveal">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal__updated reveal">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal__body">
        <p>
          Tech To Empower (&ldquo;TTE,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us&rdquo;) is a
          501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. This policy explains what information we collect
          when you visit our website or support our work, and how we handle it. We keep this
          intentionally simple because we collect very little.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Donation information.</strong> When you donate, payment is processed by
            Square. We receive confirmation of your gift and the contact details you provide,
            but we never see or store your full card number.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Contact information.</strong> If you email us or sign up to volunteer, we
            keep the details you share so we can respond and coordinate.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Basic analytics.</strong> Like most websites, we may collect anonymized,
            aggregate data about page visits to understand what&rsquo;s useful. This is not
            tied to your identity.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To process donations and send receipts for tax purposes.</li>
          <li>To respond to your messages and coordinate volunteer or partner activities.</li>
          <li>To share occasional updates about our programs — only if you opt in.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What we never do</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We do not share it with
          third parties except the service providers (such as Square) needed to process a
          donation or operate the site, and only to the extent required to do so.
        </p>

        <h2>Children&rsquo;s privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our programs serve students, but our website is directed at supporters and
          partners. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children through
          this site. If you believe a child has provided us information, contact us and we
          will remove it.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about
          you at any time. You can also unsubscribe from updates using the link in any email
          we send.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Reach us on Instagram at
          <a href="https://instagram.com/tech_to_empower" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            @tech_to_empower</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .legal {
    padding-top: calc(76px + var(--space-section));
  }
  .legal__head {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2vw, 3rem);
  }
  .legal__title {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .legal__updated {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .legal__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  .legal__body ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
  .legal__body a {
    color: var(--navy-mid);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal__body a:hover {
    color: var(--sky);
  }
</style>
